  "caveats": [
    "Prediction is expected delivered regular-season goal contribution, including NHL participation and workload risk; not isolated intrinsic talent or salary/cap valuation.",
    "Historical forecast coefficients are evaluated in chronological outer folds with nested ridge choice using only outcomes available by each origin.",
    "Historical holistic ratings and annual replacement references are retrospective reconstructions; prior research inspected these seasons. This is not untouched prospective validation.",
    "Positive-GP players with unsupported/provisional replacement scores remain unknown outcomes, never zero. Their nonrandom exclusion can bias reported accuracy.",
    "Zero NHL-delivered outcome requires absence from a fully verified completed official positive-GP cohort; missing model or source coverage is unknown.",
    "Support plus improvement over both prespecified point-MSE baselines is a research qualification rule, not independent statistical significance or causal confirmation.",
    "Horizons1–5 meet historical support; horizon6 has one outer origin, horizons7–8 have none. Unsupported long horizons remain research estimates.",
    "Residual intervals are conditional empirical ranges and omit some correlated player/team/season and source/reference uncertainty.",
    "Current2026-27 is incomplete and never supplies complete forecast targets. Raw numeric goal units are not ranks or percentiles."
  ]
